  "details": "When testing my world locally with multiple clients, I usually have the windows side by side. However, I noticed that when rejoining, the Go! button is sometimes unclickable. It seems that the trigger moved to the side.\nA video with the setup can be seen here (Bug after 0:59):\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X5nML2VBOaw\nThe occurrence seems to be consistent while the actual trigger position seems to be random.\nAlso, I set the following launch options for VRChat in Steam but none on the actual .exe files:\n-screen-width 1920 -screen-height 1080 --enable-debug-gui --enable-udon-debug-logging --fps=120 --watch-avatars",
